.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="A photoswitch A &lt;-&gt; B under simultaneous forward and reverse photolysis reaches a photostationary state (PSS) rather than running to completion. photoswitch_network reuses reversible directly, and photostationary_state gives the exact algebraic PSS composition -- checked here against direct long-time numerical integration of the ODE system.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/photochem/photostationary_state/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_photoswitch_pss_thumb.png
